The Role
Common responsibilities
Design, develop & test product-specific software of Radar System over the entire product development cycle;
Apply model-based development on a distributed embedded system; 
Work on SW-architecture, write, test and debug code according to software requirement specification and the defined process; 
Complete software module test report and integration test report according to test result;
Primarily responsible of software modules of ADAS product; 
Other job assigned by Department Manager.
Middle Level
Discuss with customer about specific solution to improve the performance of system, including function implementation and system interface. 
Senior Level
High level Collaborative Design of integrated solution in compliance with a formal ASPICE. 
Work with Software PjM to find the optimal technical solution to project challenges.
Accurately identify customer needs for Radar system, including function implementation and system interface, provide estimates for integrated system solution.
Improve operation by conducting system analysis, recommending change in policies and procedures.
Participate in and lead design quality reviews and provide mentorship to other engineers.

