Your Qualifications
Common Requirements
Bachelor degree or above, with major in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Electrical Engineering or Mechatronics; 
Experience with simulation and development tools, e.g. Vector CANoe, etc; 
Experience with C, C++ and CAPL; 
Autosar experience preferred;
Good team player and good communication skills.
Middle Level
2-5 years experience in Embedded System; 
Embedded development tool especially Rhapsody, Polyspace, WindIdea, Davinci, DOORs, PTC. 
Being familiar with 32-bit MCU, Infineon TriCore MCU is a plus;
Knowledge on Communication & Diagnostic protocols: CAN, LIN, Ethernet and TCP/IP protocols and UDS. 
Ability to communication in English. 
Senior Level
5+ years experience in Embedded System; 
Strong at embedded development tool especially Rhapsody, Polyspace, WindIdea, Davinci, DOORs, PTC.
Strong at 32-bit MCU, Infineon TriCore MCU; Bare Metal OS/RTOS & Multi-core development experience. 
Knowledge on Communication & Diagnostic protocols, Cybersecurity: CAN, LIN, Ethernet, TCP/IP protocols, J1939 and UDS. 
CI CD & Automation Development is a plus. 
FBL/Boot SW experiences is a plus.
At least one: Cyber security developments or Functional safety development experience. 
Fluent in English.
Familiarity with maturity model such as ASPICE and/or CMMI.
